# Framer marketing (`Code/Framer`)

## Published marketing pages (www.monarchcompetency.com)

`/`, `/about`, `/program`, `/resources`, `/contact`, `/referrals`, plus legal pages.

PHI routes (`/portal`, `/dashboard`, `/login`, `/admin`, `/submit-referrals`, `/r`) should stay **draft** on Framer; they run on Vercel `apps/referral-app`.

## Breakpoints

- Phone: ≤809px — **full width**; hide Desktop/Tablet layer variants (visibility eye icon).
- Tablet: 810–1199px
- Desktop: ≥1200px

Common phone bug: content at ~25–35% width with empty space — usually **desktop per-letter text** or **multiple breakpoint layers visible at once**.

## Typography on phone

- Decorative letter-per-line headlines: **replace** with normal sentence-case on Phone, don't only hide.
- Footer/menu letter-spacing (`H o m e`): normalize on Phone.

## Code components (workshop / marketing)

| Component | Phone note |
|-----------|------------|
| 3D flip cards | Tablet/Mobile may lack back face — use static front or accordion on Phone |
| `MotionCardsAccordion`, `ScrollStepsCards` | Prefer vertical stack on narrow viewports |
| `TeamReveal` / `TeamRevealGrid` | Grid → 1 column on mobile |
| `GridReveal` | 3-col → 1 col |
| `ResourcePDFList` | Stack View/Download/Share actions |
| `NavBurger` / `AuthGateway` | Nav + auth chrome |

## Sync

Theme tokens: `Code/theme/sync-framer-theme.ts`. Framer MCP can inspect/patch the live Framer project; repo `Code/Framer/*.tsx` is the git-tracked export.
